  "description": "A comprehensive, production-ready dialog library for .NET MAUI applications featuring 9 dialog types (Alert, Confirm, Prompt, Editor, Loading, ActionList, ColorPicker, Toast, Snackbar), built-in theming with dark/light mode support, internationalization (English, Spanish, French, German), custom icons, and extensive customization options. Supports iOS, Android, Windows, and macOS.",
